[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15060.79, "timestamp": "04:11:00", "text": "从你这儿捞点好处，获得影响力，变得强大，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15064.07, "timestamp": "04:11:04", "text": "然后离开。品牌忠诚度低下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15066.229, "timestamp": "04:11:06", "text": "公司忠诚度简直蠢到家了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15067.75, "timestamp": "04:11:07", "text": "必须明白，我非常专业"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15070.229, "timestamp": "04:11:10", "text": "消费者，也是生育者。而我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15072.63, "timestamp": "04:11:12", "text": "告诉你一些令人不舒服的真相。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15074.95, "timestamp": "04:11:14", "text": "这些人不需要这些该死的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15076.63, "timestamp": "04:11:16", "text": "所有机构。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15078.309, "timestamp": "04:11:18", "text": "他们不会因为扮演小丑而被录取。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15081.349, "timestamp": "04:11:21", "text": "别他妈的明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15085.269, "timestamp": "04:11:25", "text": "去 IndieP 自己组织这些活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15087.429, "timestamp": "04:11:27", "text": "联系 Mythic Talent。他们会帮助你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15090.55, "timestamp": "04:11:30", "text": "去做那件事。而且他们真的很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15092.07, "timestamp": "04:11:32", "text": "我会实话实说。我真的觉得每个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15093.59, "timestamp": "04:11:33", "text": "VTuber应该被列入神话级人才名单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15095.51, "timestamp": "04:11:35", "text": "道路。哦，呃，这真是个好消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15097.349, "timestamp": "04:11:37", "text": "如果你是一名虚拟主播，并且想要加入"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15097.393, "timestamp": "04:11:37", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15098.87, "timestamp": "04:11:38", "text": "神话级人才，请私信我。我会让你进去的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15101.91, "timestamp": "04:11:41", "text": "立即地。任何创作者。我个子小，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15104.389, "timestamp": "04:11:44", "text": "正确的？我该如何进入？嗯，他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15105.83, "timestamp": "04:11:45", "text": "愿意帮助创作者，而你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15107.51, "timestamp": "04:11:47", "text": "应该不会再得到任何东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15109.91, "timestamp": "04:11:49", "text": "我觉得如果我私信技术人员，他们会允许的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15111.83, "timestamp": "04:11:51", "text": "我接受你他妈的，我非常怀疑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15114.15, "timestamp": "04:11:54", "text": "怀疑。总之，他是一位优秀的创作者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15116.229, "timestamp": "04:11:56", "text": "这只是我的个人意见。不要高兴，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15118.71, "timestamp": "04:11:58", "text": "要给予支持。我希望玛君和加鲁拉"}]